 Data Security**\nWe take reasonable measures to help protect information about you from loss, theft, misuse and unauthorized access.\n\n**4. Third-Party Services**\nThe App uses third-party services (like Firebase and TMDB) that may collect information used to identify you. Please refer to their privacy policies.\n\n**5. Data Deletion**\nYou can delete your account and associated data at any time via the Settings menu in the App.\n"},3674,[]);
